{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56134","headline":"三涂五苦颂八首 五 · 杜光庭","name":"三涂五苦颂八首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿命有信然，弱丧谓之无。\n皆欲眼前见，过目即言悠。\n大贤明道教，惨慽悯顽夫。\n依依念子苦，勤勤令我忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}